!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Cells were plated (500 000 cells / 10cm dish) in RPMI (+10% FBS, +1% pen/strep) at 37C in 5% CO2. Next day, enzalutamide (10 uM) or vehicle was added, and cells were cultured for 5 days (medium was refreshed daily) before harvesting using Trizol.
