!Sample_description = gTLE3_ENZA_R2_ATGTCAG
!Sample_data_processing = Deseq2 was used for RNA-seq data normalization.
!Sample_data_processing = The differential expression was based on the ratio of normalized read counts (FPKM, after library size correction).
!Sample_data_processing = An absolute fold-change threshold of 2 was used. Genes with a coverage <50 in both conditions were excluded from the analyses to prevent spurious results.
